[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMjIzMzUzMDQ3MzI1NjE0MDg=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"令和８年１１月１６日、中国海軍ルーヤンⅢ級ミサイル駆逐艦及びフチ級補給艦の計２隻が、久米島の西の海域を北進したことを確認しました。\nなお、ルーヤンⅢ級ミサイル駆逐艦は、以下のとおり複数回にわたり、東シナ海と太平洋を往来したものと同一です。\n①１０月１７日、大隅海峡を東進し、太平洋へ\n②１１月１日、沖縄本島と宮古島の間の海域を北西進し、東シナ海へ\n③１１月２日、沖縄本島と宮古島の間の海域を南東進し、太平洋へ\n④１１月４日、沖縄本島と宮古島の間の海域を北西進し、東シナ海へ\n⑤１１月１２日、沖縄本島と宮古島の間の海域を南東進し、太平洋へ\nまた、フチ級補給艦は、１１月２日に沖縄本島と宮古島の間の海域を南東進し、太平洋へ向けて航行したものと同一です。\n防衛省・自衛隊は、海上自衛隊の第５航空群所属「Ｐ－３Ｃ」（那覇）により、警戒監視・情報収集を行いました。"}}},"rest_id":"2122335304791286091","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"43036","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2122488775691714976","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"18846","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2122488775691714976","sortIndex":"2122538597490884584"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":0},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1674231387166220288/iK7GwtIr_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/180585090/1680484704"},"core":{"created_at":"Fri Aug 20 00:19:17 +0000 2010","name":"厚生労働省","screen_name":"MHLWitter"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoxODA1ODUwOTA=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区霞が関　中央合同庁舎５号館"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"des